   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Progress Toward Outcome: The project has been extended to enable completion of all deliverables. Progress in achieving the project outcome of better access to safe water and improved sanitation on Ebeye is on track. All households on Ebeye now have a functioning connection to the freshwater supply network. The sewerage network has been expanded to enable all households to be connected. However, not all households have sanitary plumbing. The project&apos;s household fixture program will deliver sanitation drainage to all households that are not currently connected.</narrative>
    </title>
   </indicator>
