   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Status of Implementation Progress: Sewage pump stations have been rehabilitated, sewers cleaned, and a new outfall with screening facilities commissioned. Program is complete and 95% of the Ebeye population have been exposed to the project&apos;s hygiene awareness program. Discussions with JICA&apos;s Solar PV Project. Programs to increase gender sensitivity awareness of KAJUR staff was completed in 2018. A tariff framework has been developed and has been approved by the KAJUR Board in February 2021. The implementation of the tariff framework will start from Jan 2024.Some progress but WSS operations still male dominated. Household survey was done in Dec 2023 and in progress.</narrative>
    </title>
   </indicator>
